摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"为 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 打造的 Google Antigravity 模型提供者插件/Google Antigravity LLM provider for DeepSeek Harness with native Web OAuth, real-time quota tracking, and dynamic reasoning effort routing.","id":"gh:1338409555","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-antigravity","slug":"LiZhenNet/dsh-antigravity","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"为 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 打造的 Google Antigravity 模型提供者插件/Google Antigravity LLM provider for DeepSeek"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Harness with native Web OAuth, real-time quota tracking, and dynamic reasoning effort routing."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-antigravity"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Google Antigravity / Cloud Code Assist model provider for\nDeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This is a DSH Web plugin. It registers a DSH `LlmAdapter`\nunder provider route `antigravity`, stores"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" OAuth credentials under DSH home,\ntalks to the Cloud Code Assist streaming API directly, and provid"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"es full bilingual (English & Simplified Chinese) i18n support in the Web settings page."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Unofficial integration. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by\n> Google. Use it only w"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ith accounts and services you are authorized to access."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install into DSH Web"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Option 1: Direct from GitHub"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Option 2: From Local Release Tarball"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The package declares a DSH bundle patch, so installation automatically mounts\nthe host plugin and br"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"owser settings page."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"If your DSH version does not support `dsh plugin add`, copy the package into\nthe Web profile manuall"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" your DSH version does not support `dsh plugin add`, copy the package into\nthe Web profile manually:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Then add the plugin to the profile `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Restart DSH:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Login"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Open **Settings > Antigravity** and click **Login**. The settings page starts\nGoogle OAuth and refre"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"shes quota after login completes."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"After login, the settings page displays account information, quota grouped by model family, reset ti"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"mes, and model selector options:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Gemini Models** — Gemini Flash / Pro variants share one quota pool (green bars).\n- **Claude and "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"GPT models** — Claude Opus, Claude Sonnet, and GPT-OSS share a separate 3P quota pool (cyan bars)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Each group shows a **5-hour limit** (smooths short-term demand) and a **weekly limit** (tied to your"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" subscription tier) with a live countdown to reset."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin starts a loopback OAuth callback server at\n`http://localhost:51121/oauth-callback`. If th"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e Web service cannot open a\nbrowser, run the terminal helper on the same machine:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Credentials are stored at:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Keep that file private. It contains access and refresh tokens."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Models"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"After login, select the **Antigravity** provider in DSH's model picker. Use the\nmodel selector in **"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"Settings > Antigravity** to enable or disable individual\nmodels (enabled models are prioritized at t"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"he top of the list) — the live remaining quota percentage is shown next to each one."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Registered model IDs:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Model ID | Name | Quota pool |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| `gemini-3.7-flash` | Gemini 3.7 Flash | Gemini |\n| `gemini-3.6-flash` | Gemini 3.6 Flash | Gemini "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"|\n| `gemini-3.5-flash` | Gemini 3.5 Flash | Gemini |\n| `gemini-3.1-pro` | Gemini 3.1 Pro | Gemini |\n"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"| `gemini-3.1-flash-image` | Gemini 3.1 Flash Image | Gemini |\n| `gemini-3-flash` | Gemini 3 Flash |"},{"id":"p33s4","text":" Gemini |\n| `gemini-2.5-pro` | Gemini 2.5 Pro | Gemini |\n| `gemini-2.5-flash` | Gemini 2.5 Flash | G"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"emini |\n| `claude-opus-4-6` | Claude Opus 4.6 | Claude & GPT (3P) |\n| `claude-sonnet-4-6` | Claude S"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"onnet 4.6 | Claude & GPT (3P) |\n| `gpt-oss-120b` | GPT-OSS 120B | Claude & GPT (3P) |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Models in the same quota pool share a weekly limit and a 5-hour limit. Quota is\nconsumed proportiona"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"lly to token cost, so heavier models (e.g. Claude Opus)\ndrain the pool faster than lighter ones."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The plugin resolves these public IDs to runtime model IDs using the live\n`fetchAvailableModels` cata"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"log when available, with static routing fallbacks."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
